+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    `Bug #2166752 <https://bugs.launchpad.net/glance/+bug/2166752>`_:
+    The Cinder store now uses ``cinder_catalog_info`` and
+    ``cinder_endpoint_template`` when service credentials are set.
+    Before this fix, Glance always connected to Cinder's public
+    endpoint, which can fail when only the internal endpoint is
+    reachable.
